  "notes": "USAGE: {親睦|しんぼく} is commonly used in formal or organizational contexts - companies, schools, clubs, and international relations. It emphasizes building or strengthening relationships.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {親睦|しんぼく}を{深|ふか}める (to deepen friendship)\n- {親睦|しんぼく}を{図|はか}る (to promote goodwill)\n- {親睦会|しんぼくかい} (get-together, social gathering)\n- {親睦旅行|しんぼくりょこう} (fellowship trip)\n- {親睦|しんぼく}を{育|はぐく}む (to cultivate friendship)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {友好|ゆうこう} (friendship - often between nations)\n- {交流|こうりゅう} (exchange, interaction)\n- {懇親|こんしん} (friendship, intimacy - as in {懇親会|こんしんかい})",
